  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Curch of Sweden HUM 2013 - Curch of Sweden HUM 2013 RRM</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenska Kyrkan HUM 2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual agreement with Church of Sweden for humanitarian activities    2013. The contribution has 4 components;RRM, CBPS, regugee support    porgramme in Kenya and regugee program in South-Sudan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samlat &#xe5;rsavtal 2013 med Svenska Kyrkan.Insatsen omfattar 4           komponener; RRM, CBPS (Community Based Psychosocial Support), st&#xf6;d    till flyktingar i Kenya samt st&#xf6;d till flyktingar i Syd-Sudan. De tre f&#xf6;rsta kompenenterna &#xe4;r forts&#xe4;ttningar p&#xe5; p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende program 2012 medan det fj&#xe4;rde &#xe4;r ett nytt inslag 2013.</narrative>
  </description>
